        "original_id": "36b896cd-d876-58a0-b33d-f463872b2e55",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Teams: Miami Dolphins\n- Seasons: 2008 Miami Dolphins season, 2015 Miami Dolphins season\n- Competitions: NFL playoffs, AFC East\n- Topics: season goals, division turnaround\n\nFacts:\n- In the 2008 Miami Dolphins season, the Miami Dolphins won the AFC East.\n- In the 2008 Miami Dolphins season, the Miami Dolphins became the first team in NFL history to win their division after having only one win the previous season.\n- In 2014, the Miami Dolphins finished with an 8–8 record.\n- In the 2015 Miami Dolphins season, the Miami Dolphins aimed to improve on their 2014 8–8 record.\n- In the 2015 Miami Dolphins season, the Miami Dolphins sought to return to the NFL playoffs for the first time in seven seasons.",
